{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-ajman-one","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"ajman-one-phase-2-aqaar-al-rashidiya-3","about":"Ajman One Phase 2 is an integrated commercial and hospitality development by Aqaar, located in the Emirate of Ajman. The project features meticulous architectural design that blends tradition with modernity, and comprises four luxury towers, as well as townhouses and carefully designed commercial spaces to meet the needs of customers. The flats boast a variety of spaces and high-quality finishes that meet global standards.Ajman One Phase 2 project offers a wide range of amenities including green spaces and recreational areas, providing residents with a comfortable and sustainable environment, and facilities include a communal swimming pool, gym, BBQ area, playground and covered parking.The project is strategically located close to Ajman's vital neighbourhoods and streets. For example, Ajman Corniche beach is just a one minute drive away, 4 minutes to City Centre Ajman. Ajman University is just 7 minutes away, Sharjah Int. Airport, and 30 minutes from Dubai Int. Airport.","price":670715,"title":"Ajman One","bitrix":{"id":923,"pf_id":"are.2.1728","source":null,"project_id":"Ajman One","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Ajman One","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Aqaar","project_location":"Ajman Downtown"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2823/images/2024/08/15/340x252/FOlKF4R2h5lcekL58cAiHWznRkTDYAYWSsAZv6GW.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2823/images/2024/08/15/464x312/FOlKF4R2h5lcekL58cAiHWznRkTDYAYWSsAZv6GW.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.3941451,"lng":55.359056},"country":"ajman","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2823/images/2024/08/15/340x252/PImPkQfwrlmy12hF8CCRGgcl8LptVRv69CdSTJRA.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330